12. Government Regulation Number 38 of 2007 concerning Division of Government Affairs Between the Government, Provincial Regional Government and Regency/City Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2007 Number 82, Supplement to the State Gazette Number 4737);
13. Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 15 of 2006 concerning Forms and Types of Regional Legal Products;
14. Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 16 of 2006 concerning Procedures and Preparation of Regional Legal Products;
15. Decree of the Minister of Home Affairs and Regional Autonomy Number 5 of 2001 concerning Countermeasures for Child Labor;
16. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection of the Republic of Indonesia Number 01 of 2010 concerning Minimum Service Standards (SPM) in the field of integrated services for women and children victims of violence.
